<title>PAKISTAN: Pakistani forex market shut due to strike.</title>
<headline>Pakistani forex market shut due to strike.</headline>
<dateline>KARACHI, Pakistan 1996-09-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Pakistan's private foreign exchange market remained closed on Thursday due to opposition-called strike in Karachi, dealers said.</p>
<p>The foreign exchange market would reopen on Saturday after the Friday weekend, one dealer said.</p>
<p>On Wednesday, the rupee closed at 40.20 to the dollar in the kerb market, the dealer said.</p>
<p>-- Karachi newsroom 9221-5685192</p>
